    <StreamGeometry x:Key="IconOpen">M13,4 H20 V11 H18 V7.4 L10.7,14.7 L9.3,13.3 L16.6,6 H13 Z M5,6 H11 V8 H7 V17 H16 V13 H18 V19 H5 Z</StreamGeometry>
